  'help.use.title': '3. Tips',
  'help.use.body': '<ul><li><b>AI Camera</b> tab: keep the camera on and the running program receives hand-shape and skeleton values (📷 blocks).</li><li><b>Gamepad</b> tab: relays an Xbox/PS pad connected to this computer to the hub (🎮 blocks). SPIKE hubs can also pair with an Xbox pad directly.</li><li><b>Python</b> tab: see the Python made from your blocks; use “Edit directly” to change it and run it.</li><li><b>⬇ Download</b>: .py, a .zip for Pybricks Code, or the block project (.json).</li><li>Your work is saved in the browser automatically. To move it to another computer: File ▾ → Save project.</li><li>To stop a program: ■ Stop, or the hub’s stop button (SPIKE: center button).</li></ul>',
